    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KM PROPERTY are delighted to present 26 Binn Eadair View to the market, a stunning two-bedroom terraced home presented in immaculate condition throughout and occupying an enviable position within this highly regarded Sutton development.\n\n Viewing video https://youtu.be/FgU9DP59Kfk\n\nPerfectly positioned, the property enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy, with no properties directly overlooking it to either the front or rear. To the front, the house looks out across a beautifully maintained green, while to the rear lies a meticulously kept, maintenance-free garden incorporating a generous decked area an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\n\nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully laid out to create bright, comfortable and versatile living spaces. A welcoming entrance hallway leads into a bright and spacious living room, while beyond lies the open-plan kitchen/dining room, providing an excellent everyday living and entertaining space.\n\nA superb second living area to the rear is a particularly attractive feature of the property. Filled with natural light and opening directly onto the rear garden, it creates a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces and completes the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are two well-proportioned bedrooms. The impressive main bedroom spans the full width of the property and enjoys a lovely outlook over the green to the front through dual windows, allowing an abundance of natural light to flood the room.\n\n The second bedroom offers excellent fitted wardrobe space.\nA beautifully finished tiled bathroom, complete with walk-in shower and feature vanity/sink unit, completes the first-floor accommodation.\n\nPresented in truly immaculate condition, 26 Binn Eadair View offers purchasers the opportunity to simply unpack and enjoy. The combination of its pristine presentation, excellent living space, private outlook and beautifully maintained rear garden makes this an exceptionally appealing home in one of Sutton`s most sought-after residential settings.\n\nAccommodation\n\nWelcoming entrance hallway\n\nBright and spacious living room\n\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining room\n\nSecond living area with access to rear garden\n\nTwo bedrooms\n\nTiled bathroom with walk-in shower\n\nMaintenance-free rear garden with decked entertaining area\n\nOverlooking green to the front\n\nNot directly overlooked to front or rear\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the exceptional condition, privacy and position of this beautiful Sutton home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "HALLWAY - 1.05m (3'5\") x 0.85m (2'9\")\nWelcoming entrance hallway\n\nLIVING ROOM - 3.08m (10'1\") x 3.75m (12'4\")\nBright and spacious living room overlooking green to front\n\nKITCHEN - 1.52m (5'0\") x 2.53m (8'4\")\nPlentiful wall and floor units, open plan to..\n\nDINING AREA - 2.35m (7'9\") x 2.53m (8'4\")\nBright and open dining area with additional kitchen storage space\n\nFAMILY ROOM - 3.27m (10'9\") x 4.97m (16'4\")\nA second living area overlooking the rear garden\n\nLANDING - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.78m (5'10\")\nCarpeted landing with attic access\n\nBEDROOM ONE - 3.89m (12'9\") x 2.79m (9'2\")\nSpanning the width of the home with dual windows, a bright and spacious double bedroom overlooking the green at the front\n\nBEDROOM TWO - 2.16m (7'1\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nCurrently in use as a home office with plentiful fitted wardrobe space, overlooking rear garden\n\nBATHROOM - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.62m (5'4\")\nTiled bathroom with walk-in-shower, WC and feature sink unit\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
